---
title: "Sequence 2: Review, approve and render"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant UI as Web UI (React)
  participant API as API server (FastAPI)
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant W as Worker process
  participant FF as FFmpeg
  U->>UI: Open Review
  UI->>API: GET /api/jobs/{id} + preview (Range)
  API->>DB: read words + cuts
  API-->>UI: transcript, cuts, 480p video
  loop each keep / cut click
    UI->>API: PATCH /cuts/{cut_id} {kept}
    API->>DB: update cut
    API-->>UI: new clean duration
  end
  U->>UI: Approve & render (mp4 / xml / both)
  UI->>API: POST /api/jobs/{id}/render
  API->>W: dispatch render
  W->>DB: read active cuts
  W->>FF: trim + concat + crossfade, encode
  FF-->>W: name_clean.mp4 (or FCP XML)
  W->>DB: span render_mp4, job done
  API-->>UI: SSE done, Show in Finder
